  <!--
    [✓] Perfect video optimization system implemented
    [✓] Prevents stretching and pixelation across all sections
    [✓] Lazy loading for improved performance
    [✓] Connection-aware quality adjustment
    [✓] Texture videos load seamlessly with alternating patterns
    [ ] Integration benefits section drives traffic to complete plans
    [ ] Plan integration overview shows value of combined services
    [ ] Comparison table clearly differentiates integrated vs standalone
    [ ] Standalone section positioned as secondary option
    [ ] Enhanced FAQ addresses integration questions
